                </TextRuns>
                <Style />
              </Paragraph>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value EvaluationMode="Auto">We hereby certify and confirm that the applicant is in our employment and that he has no negative records in HR that may frustrate the repayment of the loan. We further confirm that his/her salary is capable of meeting the loan repayment as applied and will not suffer deductions in excess of the 2/3 rule. The company undertakes to deduct the repayment amount and remit to the Sacco on a monthly basis until the Sacco advises otherwise. The company undertakes to inform the society in the event the loanee is discharged from the company. </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontFamily>Maiandra GD</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>10pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style />
